## IDevelopPlanService

**Namespace:** `Cyrena.Coding.Contracts`
**Assembly:** `Cyrena.Coding.Core`

### Purpose
Provides access to the current `DevelopPlan` and allows replacing it (used when switching between projects in a multi-project solution). Also exposes observable hooks for plan and file lifecycle events.

### Interface Definition

```csharp
public interface IDevelopPlanService
{
    DevelopPlan Plan { get; }
    void SetPlan(DevelopPlan newPlan);

    IDisposable OnDevelopPlanChanged(Action<DevelopPlan> plan);
    IDisposable OnFileCreated(Action<DevelopFile> cb);
    IDisposable OnFileUpdated(Action<DevelopFile> cb);
    IDisposable OnFileDeleted(Action<DevelopFile> cb);

    void InvokeFileCreated(DevelopFile file);
    void InvokeFileUpdated(DevelopFile file);
    void InvokeFileDeleted(DevelopFile file);
}
```

### Members

| Member | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `Plan` | Gets the current `DevelopPlan` instance. |
| `SetPlan(DevelopPlan)` | Replaces the current plan (used during project switching). |
| `OnDevelopPlanChanged(Action<DevelopPlan>)` | Subscribes a callback invoked whenever `SetPlan` is called. Returns an `IDisposable` for unsubscribing. |
| `OnFileCreated(Action<DevelopFile>)` | Subscribes a callback invoked when a file is created. Returns an `IDisposable` for unsubscribing. |
| `OnFileUpdated(Action<DevelopFile>)` | Subscribes a callback invoked when a file is updated. Returns an `IDisposable` for unsubscribing. |
| `OnFileDeleted(Action<DevelopFile>)` | Subscribes a callback invoked when a file is deleted. Returns an `IDisposable` for unsubscribing. |
| `InvokeFileCreated(DevelopFile)` | Raises the file-created event; called by plugins/services after creating a file. |
| `InvokeFileUpdated(DevelopFile)` | Raises the file-updated event; called by plugins/services after updating a file. |
| `InvokeFileDeleted(DevelopFile)` | Raises the file-deleted event; called by plugins/services after deleting a file. |

### Implementation

`DevelopPlanService` (internal, in Cyrena.Coding.Extension):
```csharp
internal class DevelopPlanService : IDevelopPlanService
{
    public DevelopPlanService(DevelopPlan plan) { _plan = plan; }
    private DevelopPlan _plan { get; set; }
    public DevelopPlan Plan => _plan;
    public void SetPlan(DevelopPlan newPlan) { _plan = newPlan; }
}
```

### Registration
Registered as singleton in `DeveloperAssistantMode.ConfigureAsync`:
```csharp
var plan_service = new DevelopPlanService(plan);
builder.Services.AddSingleton<IDevelopPlanService>(plan_service);
```

### Usage
- Injected into Semantic Kernel plugins (FileActions, ProjectInformation)
- Used by `ISolutionController` to switch active projects
- Provides `Plan` property for file operations (`TryFindFile`, `TryReadFileContent`, etc.)
- Event hooks allow plugins and services to react to plan changes and file CRUD operations without tight coupling.
